OL,3,CNewcastle purchase Woolsington Hall
OL,4,Csite for new training ground
OL,6,FNewcastle United have announced they
OL,7,Fhave reached an agreement to purchase
OL,8,Fland for a new #190 million training
OL,9,Fground.
OL,11,FThe club is to purchase the 260-acre
OL,12,FWoolsington Hall estate, which
OL,13,Fincludes a derelict listed country
OL,14,Fhouse and parkland, close to the
OL,15,Fcity's airport and develop what it
OL,16,Fcalls a "world-class training complex"
OL,17,Fsubject to planning permission.
