OL,3,CNewcastle purchase Woolsington Hall
OL,4,Csite for new training ground
OL,6,FA formal planning application is
OL,7,Fexpected to be submitted early next
OL,8,Fyear with the men's first team due to
OL,9,Fmove to the site, which was previously
OL,10,Fpurchased by former chairman Sir John
OL,11,FHall as a potential academy venue in
OL,12,F1994, for the 2029-30 campaign.
OL,14,FThe master plan for the site will also
OL,15,Fretain the flexibility to integrate
OL,16,Fbespoke women's and girls' facilities.
OL,18,FThe club added that this phased
OL,19,Fapproach ensures investment is both
OL,20,Fimmediate and sustainable.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/4
