OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1787732302
OL,3,CNewcastle purchase Woolsington Hall
OL,4,Csite for new training ground
OL,6,FSpeaking about the development, which
OL,7,Fis being funded by Saudi Arabia's
OL,8,FPublic Investment Fund and RB Sports
OL,9,Fand Media, chief executive David
OL,10,FHopkinson said: "This is a landmark
OL,11,Fmoment for Newcastle.
OL,13,F"Subject to planning permission, our
OL,14,Fproposed performance complex will
OL,15,Fcreate the world's best performance
OL,16,Fenvironment for our teams. We'll
OL,17,Fdevelop purpose-built facilities that
OL,18,Fare geared towards developing
OL,19,Fsustainable success in the future,
OL,20,Fwhere players, coaches and staff can
OL,21,Fperform at their very best every day.
OL,26,@rD@QOUuD@AOU
