FL,318,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1787732302
OL,3,CNewcastle purchase Woolsington Hall
OL,4,Csite for new training ground
OL,6,F"We will be submitting a detailed
OL,7,Fplanning application that not only
OL,8,Fdemonstrates our vision, but also how
OL,9,Fwe will preserve and enhance an
OL,10,Fhistoric estate, its biodiversity and
OL,11,Fwildlife habitats, and how we'll be a
OL,12,Fgreat neighbour.
OL,14,F"I want to thank everyone who has
OL,15,Fplayed a role in getting us to this
OL,16,Fpoint today, and extend my gratitude
OL,17,Fto Sir John and the Hall family."
OL,26,@nD@AOU
